	(text "PARALLEL GPIO SUBSYSTEM (82C55 PPI — PORTS $00..$03)\n- U9: CP82C55A-5Z (DIP-40), C15: 100nF ceramic decoupling capacitor\n- J2: 26-pin (13x2) 2.54mm horizontal box header (Odd 1..15 = PA0..PA7, Even 2..16 = PB0..PB7, 17..24 = PC0..PC7, 25 = GND, 26 = GPIO_PWR_SELECT)\n- JP3: 1x3 2.54mm header (Pin 1 = +5V, Pin 2 = GPIO_PWR_SELECT, Pin 3 = GND; shunt 1-2 = +5V default, 2-3 = GND)\n- External Accessories Note: Excluded as BOM symbols (Qualtek QAWA-24-12-US01, DTECH DT-9008, DTECH DT-5002A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
